// The strings the engine itself may show at any time, with retail's
// localized_code_post_gfx_mp, which is never unloaded (libiw4x's
// zone/engine/patch-zones.cxx loads this zone with it). Error messages
// belong here: the UI zones are freed while a map loads and plays, and an
// error raised then is localized at once, so a key only the UI zones carry
// shows as the key.
//
>game,IW4MS

localize,iw4x_localized_code_post_gfx_mp
